    description: "BlockSuite (MPL-2.0) arrives in PlazaFlow v1.5 as the unified document layer: EdgelessEditor (whiteboard), PageEditor (rich text), database blocks (kanban). Its data model IS Yjs. If hypergumbo can detect BlockSuite Workspace/Doc interfaces and block schema with meta:createdBy fields, it can trace attribution and erasure data paths. Lower priority — PlazaFlow v1.5 is far out. No bakeoff repos currently available (AFFiNE uses BlockSuite but not in repo pool). Cross-refs: WI-mamuh (Yjs sub-document tracing — BlockSuite sub-docs are Yjs docs)."  # 97df
